[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2700.79, "timestamp": "00:45:00", "text": "更好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2702.95, "timestamp": "00:45:02", "text": "现在没有别的了。呃，如果有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2704.47, "timestamp": "00:45:04", "text": "如果有人想获得，就给他/她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2706.95, "timestamp": "00:45:06", "text": "健康方面，他们可以做到。我已经买了一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2709.589, "timestamp": "00:45:09", "text": "为了我自己的健康。哦，等等。我哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2711.99, "timestamp": "00:45:11", "text": "等待。这是……哦，这不是厕所。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2714.069, "timestamp": "00:45:14", "text": "我做不到不用上厕所。该死的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2716.87, "timestamp": "00:45:16", "text": "它。好的，那我就买这个吧。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2719.829, "timestamp": "00:45:19", "text": "我的天哪，各位。瞧，就是它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2722.87, "timestamp": "00:45:22", "text": "娜。存在冲刺速度。有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2724.39, "timestamp": "00:45:24", "text": "如果需要，可以升级冲刺速度。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2732.87, "timestamp": "00:45:32", "text": "我们正在进行“所有人的HP都满了吗？”的测试。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2736.55, "timestamp": "00:45:36", "text": "我100岁了。我95岁了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2738.309, "timestamp": "00:45:38", "text": "等等，那边有免费的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2740.71, "timestamp": "00:45:40", "text": "这里。等等，算了。它不是免费的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2743.829, "timestamp": "00:45:43", "text": "如果你想的话，你可以利用这个漏洞。我可以吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2747.75, "timestamp": "00:45:47", "text": "它不是免费的。如何利用这个漏洞？呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2750.23, "timestamp": "00:45:50", "text": "所以一旦飞船启动，就开始狂轰滥炸。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2752.95, "timestamp": "00:45:52", "text": "上面有E。好了，上船吧。开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2756.55, "timestamp": "00:45:56", "text": "疯狂刷屏E。大家都准备好了吗？是的。开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2758.43, "timestamp": "00:45:58", "text": "垃圾邮件"}]